1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,760
 In this lecture, we are going to discuss about another AWS AI service in the area of natural

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:09,520
 language processing called as Amazon Comprehend.

3
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:15,760
 Amazon Comprehend derives and understands valuable insights from

4
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:22,320
 text and the text could be informed documents, email, or web pages.

5
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:27,680
 Now let's try and understand how Amazon Comprehend works.

6
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:34,400
 So, you have Amazon Comprehend, then as an input, you could have social media feed or your emails,

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,240
 call center records, etc.

8
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:44,240
 Amazon Comprehend can analyze the data on these different data sources and then generate insights.

9
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:48,640
 Now, let's try and understand what generating insight means.

10
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:57,120
 So, the first one is it can detect PII, let's say you are an insurer and one of the customers

11
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:04,640
 has posted a complaint on your social media channel, let's say Instagram or Facebook saying that

12
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:09,920
 this is the policy number name address and it has certain complaint against the organization.

13
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:18,400
 So, what Amazon Comprehend can do is it can review that data feed and detect any PII information.

14
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:24,080
 Then it can also do sentiment analysis, let's say you launched a new product in the market

15
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:28,320
 and you are getting a lot of feedback, it can be on social media or it can be,

16
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:32,480
 it can be complaints that are coming to your call center or emails.

17
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:40,880
 So, Amazon Comprehend can generate the sentiment analysis on all the feedback that you are getting

18
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:45,040
 and it can classify it as positive neutral or negative.

19
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:52,240
 So, the third focus area for Amazon Comprehend is recognize entities or entity recognition.

20
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:56,480
 So, let's say there is some chatter going on in our social media feed.

21
00:01:56,480 --> 00:02:05,440
 Amazon Comprehend can then do the entity recognition and recognize the objects within the field

22
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:10,240
 and classify them into some predefined categories like name of the person,

23
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:14,640
 name of the organization that is being spoken about, location and so on.

24
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:22,000
 Then it can also detect key phrases from data and key phrases basically identifies

25
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:29,280
 the central idea of a particular post or email etc that has been sent.

26
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:33,600
 And it can also auto detect the language of the content.

27
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:38,640
 So, now let's see what are the key use cases for Amazon Comprehend.

28
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:45,120
 So, it can be used for call center analytics, customer support tickets and it could do various

29
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:51,440
 things, it could detect PII, it could do sentiment analysis, recognize entities, key phrases, etc.

30
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:59,760
 Then it can be also used to secure documents by redacting the PII from documents where it is not

31
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:06,080
 required. So, I said you could get an email with a complaint and which provides all the PII

32
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:12,400
 information or somebody could post on social media feedback with the PII data and it can be used

33
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:18,560
 to redirect the PII from documents. And then it could also be used for processing the financial

34
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:25,040
 documents by classifying and extracting entities from insurance claims.

35
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:28,720
 So, those are some of the use cases for Amazon Comprehend.

